            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The dashboard shows that the Consumer segment and West region contribute the highest sales and profits. Phones and Chairs are the most profitable categories, while Tables generate lower profit margins despite good sales. Standard Class shipping is most preferred by customers. California leads state-wise sales performance. The company should focus on improving South region sales and increasing profitability in furniture-related products.</run>
